Third-party data bundled in sasori/data/ is CC0 (public domain):
MakeHuman base mesh, targets, weights and eyes (makehumancommunity/makehuman) and
the Mesh2Motion human rig and animations (scottpetrovic/mesh2motion-app).
The release bundles also contain Python (PSF License) and Blender's bpy module
(GPL-3.0-or-later, source at https://projects.blender.org/blender/blender).
